/// If [clipper] is non-null, then [borderRadius] is ignored.
///
/// If [clipBehavior] is [Clip.none], no clipping will be applied.¿␀á	¿␀á␀␀¿␀á#%¿␀á)␀␀¿␀áN¿␀áT␀␀¿␀á`"¿␀áf␀␀¿␀áà¿␀áè␀␀¿␀á7¿␀áC¿␀áD¿␀át¿␀áx¿␀áy¿␀áûÄˇ¿␀àëÄÀ/// The border radius of the rounded corners.
///
/// Values are clamped so that horizontal and vertical radii sums do not
