///  * The [catalog of layout widgets](https://flutter.dev/widgets/layout/).␀¿Îu␀¿Î[¿Îc3/// Creates a widget that visually hides its child.¿Îe	¿Îl␀␀¿Îp¿Îv␀␀¿ÎÜ¿Îç␀␀¿ÎÄ¿ÎòÇ¿ÓÇQ/// Whether the child is hidden from the rest of the tree.
