/// Defaults to [Clip.none].␀¿VH¿ó1/// {@macro flutter.rendering.RenderFlex.spacing}␀¿£Å.¿¨␀␀␀␀¿’Ñè¿‘Éƒ/// The value to pass to [RenderFlex.textDirection].
///
/// This value is derived from the [textDirection] property and the ambient
