␀␀¿¿+␀␀¿3¿>␀␀¿˘¿˙¿iÄÜ¿z␀␀¿ë¿ü␀␀¿i¿j␀¿ì¶¿!ÉÙ/// A widget that calls callbacks in response to common pointer events.
